# Research data — not for public distribution
# research/ — scripts and method are TRACKED; data and outputs are not.
#
# This was a blanket `research/` ignore until 2026-08-05, which meant the
# provenance of constants that ship in the product lived outside version
# control. GAZE_CALIBRATION in src/visual/attention-transport.ts cites a sweep
# in research/study1/run-optimize.ts; that citation pointed at a file nobody
# else could see, so the shipped number was unreproducible from the repo.
#
# Excluded below: the UEyes corpus (26 GB), result JSON/CSV, caches, venvs.
# A reader can re-derive every result by downloading the corpus and running the
# scripts, which is the point.
research/study1/UEyes_dataset/
research/study1/__MACOSX/
research/study1/venv/
research/study1/results/
research/study1/.cache-features.json
research/study1/features.json
research/benchmark/results/
research/benchmark/.tmp-audits/
# Raw crawl output; the shipped reference is src/data/ctc-reference-*.ts.
research/ctc-reference/results/
research/**/*.zip
research/**/*.tar.gz
research/**/__pycache__/
research/study1/features.csv

# ...but the results README is documentation, not data. It is the file that says
# which number in that directory is true and which was retracted, so it is the
# one thing in results/ a reader most needs.
!research/study1/results/
research/study1/results/*
!research/study1/results/README.md

# PAI / oh-my-claudecode artifacts (personal AI infrastructure)
